sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EB as EventBridge (cron)
    participant L as Lambda Ingest (AWS)
    participant IBGE as IBGE API
    participant S3 as S3 Parquet (AWS)
    participant P as Programa Solana (provenance)

    EB->>L: trigger (mensal/dia 15)
    L->>IBGE: GET agregado IPCA
    IBGE-->>L: JSON série temporal
    L->>L: parse + normalize + validate
    L->>S3: PUT parquet (particionado year/month)
    L->>L: calcula SHA-256 do arquivo
    L->>P: store_dataset(hash, metadados) → PDA
    P-->>L: confirmação on-chain
    L-->>EB: 200 (recordsCount)

    Note over P: verify_dataset(hash) permite<br/>qualquer cliente validar<br/>integridade sem confiar na AWS
